{"answer":"Switching to flat AI view.","chat_id":"chat-parity-atxpage1","guard_stats":{"completion_tokens":2,"elapsed_ms":0,"input_messages":[{"content":"You are a safety guard classifier. Follow the prompt format exactly.","role":"system"},{"content":"Treat observability, SRE, incident-response, and security-hardening troubleshooting as safe by default unless there is clear malicious or illegal intent.\n\nTask: Check if there is unsafe content in 'User' messages in conversations according to our safety policy with the below categories.\n\n<BEGIN UNSAFE CONTENT CATEGORIES>\nS1: Violent Crimes.\nS2: Non-Violent Crimes.\nS3: Sex-Related Crimes.\nS4: Child Sexual Exploitation.\nS5: Defamation.\nS6: Specialized Advice.\nS7: Privacy.\nS8: Intellectual Property.\nS9: Indiscriminate Weapons.\nS10: Hate.\nS11: Suicide & Self-Harm.\nS12: Sexual Content.\nS13: Elections.\nS14: Code Interpreter Abuse.\n<END UNSAFE CONTENT CATEGORIES>\n\nCalibration rules for this domain:\n- Technical observability terms are usually benign: p50/p95/p99, percentile bands, error budget burn, burst, spike, kill process, incident, root cause, exploit detection, vulnerability triage.\n- Mark unsafe only when the user clearly asks to commit harm, abuse, fraud, data theft, or illegal action.\n- Do not classify as S3/S12 unless there is explicit sexual content or sexual-crime intent.\n- Do not classify as S1/S2 unless there is explicit intent to commit real-world violence/non-violent crime.\n\n<BEGIN CONVERSATION>\n\nUser: Context: /logs\n\nUser input: Switch to the flat AI view.\n\n<END CONVERSATION>\n\nProvide your safety assessment for ONLY THE LAST User message in the above conversation:\n- First line must read 'safe' or 'unsafe'.\n- If unsafe, a second line must include a comma-separated list of violated categories.","role":"user"}],"prompt_tokens":128,"system_instructions":"You are a safety guard classifier. Follow the prompt format exactly.","thinking_tokens":0},"model":"sobs-parity-model","model_stats":{"completion_tokens":18,"elapsed_ms":0,"prompt_tokens":215,"thinking_tokens":0},"ok":true,"saved_memory_ids":[],"thinking_level":"off","tool_proposals":[{"action":{"query":{"view":"flat"},"target_page":"/ai","type":"navigate"},"action_id":"ai.view.flat","action_token":".254bb9f86eee159eca8f1c9a321e4f449ac3144addd622d8d39aa30bf58e6143","requires_confirmation":true,"summary":"Switch to flat AI transparency view","tool":"propose_ui_action","unsupported":false}],"turn_id":"turn-parity-atxpage1","turn_logs_url":"/logs?sql=ServiceName%20%3D%20%27sobs-ai-helper%27%20AND%20LogAttributes%5B%27gen_ai.chat_id%27%5D%20%3D%20%27chat-parity-atxpage1%27%20AND%20LogAttributes%5B%27gen_ai.turn_id%27%5D%20%3D%20%27turn-parity-atxpage1%27","turn_summary":{"action":"propose ai.view.flat","request":"switch to flat view","result":"action found on target page"}}
